<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Feb real PPI +0.5 pct mo/mo, +4.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Feb real PPI +0.5 pct mo/mo, +4.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial producer prices were 0.5 percent higher in February, putting prices 4.2 percent higher than in the same month in 1996, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
